<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results on the</p>
<p>seventh day of the French Open tennis tournament on Sunday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Fourth round:</p>
<p>*2-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat 13-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>*Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Nicole Arendt (U.S.) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 7-Conchita Martinez</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-7 (4-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
